{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܕܘܝܕ، ܟܲܕ ܥܪܝܩ ܠܗ ܡ̣ܢ ܩܕܡ ܐܒ݂ܫܠܘܡ ܒܪܘܢܗ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܟܡܵܐ ܙܝܼܕܹܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܡܲܠܝܸܨܵܢܝܼ̈،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܪܵܒܵܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܩܵܝܡܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܥܲܠܝܼ،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܪܵܒܵܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܐܵܡܪ̈ܵܢܹܐ ܒܘܼܬ ܓܵܢܝܼ:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܠܲܝܬ ܠܹܗ ܦܘܼܨܵܝܵܐ ܒܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ.“ ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܐܲܢ݇ܬ، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܡܵܛܵܠܵܐ ܝܘܸܬ ܠܚܵܕܸܪ̈ܘܵܢܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܚܸܩܪܝܼ ܘܡܲܪܡܵܢܵܐ ܕܪܹܝܫܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܩܵܠܝܼ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܩܵܪܹܝܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܟܹܐ ܓ̰ܲܘܸܒ ܠܝܼ ܡ̣ܢ ܛܘܼܪܵܐ ܕܩܘܼܕܫܹܗ. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܵܢܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܕܵܡܟܹܢ ܘܛܵܠܥܹܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܪܵܥܫܹܢ، ܣܵܒܵܒ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܣܵܢܹܕ ܠܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܹܐ ܙܵܕܥܹܢ ܡ̣ܢ ܪܸ̈ܒܘܵܬܹ‌ܐ ܕܥܲܡܡܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܝܢܝܼ ܕܟܪܝܼܟ݂ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܠܕܲܠܩܘܼܒ݂ܠܝܼ ܡ̣ܢ ܟܠܔ ܓܹܒܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܘܼܡ، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ! ܦܲܪܸܩ ܠܝܼ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗ‌ܝܼ!","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܡܸܚܝܵܝ ܝܘܸܬ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܕܸܫ̃ܡܸܢܝܼ̈ ܥܲܠܔ ܦܵܬܵܝܗ‌ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܟܹ̈ܐ ܕܒܝܼܫܹ̈ܐ ܬܒ݂ܝܼܪܵܝ ܝܘܸܬ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܦܘܼܨܵܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܠܔ ܥܲܡܘܼܟ݂ ܝܼܠܵܗ̇ ܒܘܼܪܟܬܘܼܟ݂. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}